    <guid isPermaLink="false">69286074f2b167179816a19a</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 28 Nov 2025 09:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>各位朋友好啊，我们今天跟大家说一道适合冬天吃得菜，暖胃又通气！它就是 --- 萝卜连锅汤！</span></p><span></span><p><span>俗话说的好，冬吃萝卜夏吃姜，冬天正是吃萝卜的时候，刚入冬的时候白萝卜可正是最好吃的时候！不辣！还甜！今天我们跟大家就来说说白萝卜的汤菜，又暖和又养生！</span></p><span></span><p><span>收听目录：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="126">02:06</a> 水果蔬菜蔚然成风</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="420">07:00</a> 为啥餐馆里的白萝卜生吃也不辣</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="600">10:00</a> 萝卜卖出鲍鱼价？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="980">16:20</a> 为啥鲁菜少有后调味</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1250">20:50</a> 40年前就备注不吃葱姜蒜？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1530">25:30</a> 自助火锅小料是瞎扯？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1883">31:23</a> 萝卜连锅汤做法</span></p><span></span><p><span>祝各位每天好心情，上下通气各种BU BU !&nbsp;</span></p>]]></description>
