  <item>
    <title>秋日暖菜：一口咬开自贡盐井的江湖烟火</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68ea0116525f51df38c29ca6</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68ea0116525f51df38c29ca6</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 11 Oct 2025 07:06:57 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<h3><span>各位好，今天我们跟大家说一道江湖菜 — 姜芽鸭丝</span></h3><span></span><p><span>姜芽鸭丝属于</span><strong><span>自贡盐帮菜</span></strong><span>中的家常小炒，而盐帮菜本身则源于四川自贡深厚的盐业文化。自贡自古为“千年盐都”，盐业始于东汉，盛于明清。因盐致富的盐商与数量庞大的盐工，形成了“盐商菜”与“盐工菜”两大饮食体系：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>盐商菜</span></strong><span>：讲究精工细作，口味清淡鲜嫩；</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>。</span><strong><span>盐工菜</span></strong><span>：重油重辣，突出刺激与下饭功能，强调“味厚、味重、味丰”</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>姜芽鸭丝正体现了盐工菜的特点：</span><strong><span>快火爆炒、仔姜提味、辣香浓郁</span></strong><span>，是典型的“下饭神器”。</span></p><span></span><h3><span>🌶 姜与鸭的“川味逻辑”</span></h3><span></span><p><span>。四川人**“尚滋味，好辛香”</span><strong><span>，尤其擅长用</span></strong><span>仔姜、鲜椒、花椒**等本地调味食材来激发主料的鲜香。在自贡，仔姜不仅是调味品，更是菜肴的主角之一。像“仔姜田鸡”“仔姜兔”“仔姜鸭丝”等，都是以仔姜命名的经典小炒</span></p><span></span><p><span>而鸭与姜的搭配，也暗合中医“寒热平衡”的饮食智慧：鸭肉性凉，仔姜性温，两者结合，既能去腥提香，又有调和之效。</span></p><span></span><h3><span>📜 虽无传说，却有“江湖”</span></h3><span></span><p><span>虽然姜芽鸭丝没有像“宫保鸡丁”那样明确的历史人物或宫廷典故，但它的诞生逻辑非常清晰：</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>在盐井林立、工人密集的自贡，厨房就是江湖，锅铲就是武器。一群重口味、重体力的盐工，需要快速、刺激、下饭的菜式。于是，厨师用现杀的鸭、现摘的仔姜、现剁的辣椒，一炒而成——姜芽鸭丝，便在这烟火气中诞生。</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>（百度百科提炼）</span></p><span></span><p><span>收听目录：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="250">04:10</a> 吹牛皮的豆干</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="660">11:00</a> 姜芽炒鸭丝</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="760">12:40</a> 有没有这个菜取决于店里是否自己腌泡菜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1124">18:44</a> 如何做鱼丝</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1560">26:00</a> &nbsp;鸭丝怎么来的？拿手撕？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2110">35:10</a> 鸭丝部位多才好</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2510">41:50</a> 泡椒加嫩姜 配上煮熟的鸭子&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎各位评论转发打赏点赞！</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6596c3f78b74718642c0ab92/lpXNKCu_K8en2y28dPj7O6EXp3iF.m4a" length="93959458" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:48:39</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fr78T945CmD3VBkHo7j2O-a8vsSS.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>软若无骨的柔韧性!原来全靠技术就能实现！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68e1d6fe8bf86095c5d42f1b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68e1d6fe8bf86095c5d42f1b</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 05 Oct 2025 02:27:55 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>各位好，今天我们来一起聊聊整鸭出骨的名菜--八宝酿鸭子！</span></p><span></span><p><span>八宝鸭是中国传统名菜，流行于</span><a href="https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E8%8B%8F%E5%B7%9E/122945?fromModule=lemma_inlink" data-url="https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E8%8B%8F%E5%B7%9E/122945?fromModule=lemma_inlink"><span>苏州</span></a><span>、</span><a href="https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E4%B8%8A%E6%B5%B7/114606?fromModule=lemma_inlink" data-url="https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E4%B8%8A%E6%B5%B7/114606?fromModule=lemma_inlink"><span>上海</span></a><span>及</span><a href="https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E5%AE%A2%E5%AE%B6%E5%9C%B0%E5%8C%BA/4583858?fromModule=lemma_inlink" data-url="https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E5%AE%A2%E5%AE%B6%E5%9C%B0%E5%8C%BA/4583858?fromModule=lemma_inlink"><span>客家地区</span></a><span>，属沪菜、苏菜和客家菜系。该菜起源于清代宫廷，乾隆三十年</span><a href="https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E8%8B%8F%E5%B7%9E%E7%BB%87%E9%80%A0/6735106?fromModule=lemma_inlink" data-url="https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E8%8B%8F%E5%B7%9E%E7%BB%87%E9%80%A0/6735106?fromModule=lemma_inlink"><span>苏州织造</span></a><span>进贡的“</span><a href="https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E7%B3%AF%E7%B1%B3%E5%85%AB%E5%AE%9D%E9%B8%AD/9271998?fromModule=lemma_inlink" data-url="https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E7%B3%AF%E7%B1%B3%E5%85%AB%E5%AE%9D%E9%B8%AD/9271998?fromModule=lemma_inlink"><span>糯米八宝鸭</span></a><span>”即为其前身 ，1930年代经</span><a href="https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E4%B8%8A%E6%B5%B7%E5%9F%8E%E9%9A%8D%E5%BA%99%E8%80%81%E9%A5%AD%E5%BA%97/10697735?fromModule=lemma_inlink" data-url="https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E4%B8%8A%E6%B5%B7%E5%9F%8E%E9%9A%8D%E5%BA%99%E8%80%81%E9%A5%AD%E5%BA%97/10697735?fromModule=lemma_inlink"><span>上海城隍庙老饭店</span></a><span>改良后广泛流传，2018年入选“</span><a href="https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E8%8F%9C/1449586?fromModule=lemma_inlink" data-url="https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E8%8F%9C/1449586?fromModule=lemma_inlink"><span>中国菜</span></a><span>”上海十大经典名菜 。</span></p><span></span><p><span>传统做法以带骨鸭开背，填入糯米、火腿、冬笋、干贝等八种配料，封碗蒸制后浇淋虾仁青豆卤汁 。上海本帮菜版本保留鸭背骨蒸制，肉质酥烂且酱汁渗透，形成地域特色。</span><a href="https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E7%8E%89%E6%9E%97/915223?fromModule=lemma_inlink" data-url="https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E7%8E%89%E6%9E%97/915223?fromModule=lemma_inlink"><span>玉林</span></a><span>等地改良版以</span><a href="https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E8%8D%94%E6%B5%A6%E8%8A%8B/150152?fromModule=lemma_inlink" data-url="https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E8%8D%94%E6%B5%A6%E8%8A%8B/150152?fromModule=lemma_inlink"><span>荔浦芋</span></a><span>、</span><a href="https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E8%96%8F%E7%B1%B3/3116601?fromModule=lemma_inlink" data-url="https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E8%96%8F%E7%B1%B3/3116601?fromModule=lemma_inlink"><span>薏米</span></a><span>取代部分配料，配比本土调味料并采用炸、煲复合工艺（百度百科）</span></p><span></span><p><span>收听目录：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="100">01:40</a> 好的技校校企结合，紧跟一线</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="170">02:50</a> 一道八宝酿鸭子做一天</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="280">04:40</a> 整鸭脱骨</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1200">20:00</a> 酿鸭子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1880">31:20</a> 厨师早晨来了都干嘛</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2160">36:00</a> 勺不过五</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2550">42:30</a> 厨师要少说话？</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎各位点赞收藏转发打赏！祝大家假期快乐！</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6596c3f78b74718642c0ab92/ltdSBr7LzLpL9jQmssHuY08NrePN.m4a" length="93649623" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:48:29</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fr78T945CmD3VBkHo7j2O-a8vsSS.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>草根逆袭！谁说边角料不能成主角！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68d8a82cb4befcf73040cc31</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68d8a82cb4befcf73040cc31</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 28 Sep 2025 03:18:48 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>老师傅常说一句话：厨房里无废料！今天我们这道菜就是四川菜对这句话得演绎。</span></p><span></span><p><span>据说，江津肉片创始于清末。其时，江津城的河街（现竹器街）有一家“兴隆饭馆”，主要经营一些家常的川菜小炒，由于价廉物美，味道巴适，深得南来北往的客商以及出门在外的赶路人喜爱，生意还不错。</span></p><span></span><p><span>忙碌一天下来，饭馆里每天都会剩下很多猪肉的边角料，奇形怪状，有肥有瘦，有粗有细，很不好处理。丢了很可惜，不丢又大大小小不成形。这天晚上，老板突发奇想，将这些边角料全部码味、裹芡，下油锅炸成两面焦黄的油炸肉片，然后再勾调出一种酸辣回甜的调料。第二天，有客人来，就抓一把油炸肉片，淋上自制的调料上桌，没想到食客们非常喜欢，纷纷称赞其味道独特。 由于这道菜是用边角料制作的，价格非常公道亲民，更是受到食客们的追捧。</span></p><span></span><p><span>因为这道菜发源于江津，食客们亲切地称其为“江津肉片”。</span></p><span></span><p><span>收听目录：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="60">01:00</a> 江津肉片来源地名</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="210">03:30</a> 江津肉片用什么部位</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="420">07:00</a> 二刀肉怎么渐渐不提了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1110">18:30</a> 欧洲猪肉不好吃？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1600">26:40</a> 肉片的多种选择</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2050">34:10</a> 鱼香肉丝的争论</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2380">39:40</a> 江津肉片做法</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎大家点赞收藏转发！感谢您！</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6596c3f78b74718642c0ab92/lp6g2kQN3fIrWlSLrQ-woTzcCRYu.m4a" length="89954946" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:46:34</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fr78T945CmD3VBkHo7j2O-a8vsSS.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
